{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"OBA","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"俄巴底亞書","commonName":"俄巴底亞書","title":"俄巴底亞書","order":31,"numberOfChapters":1,"sha256":"69b379c6de8a703527cd33e07c21b4660fe0dcb9a89621a6c6df98c704ad0a9f","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/OBA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":1,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/OBA/1.json","totalNumberOfVerses":21},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"俄巴底亞得了耶和華的默示。","poem":1},"耶和華要懲罰以東",{"text":"論以東說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我從耶和華那裏聽見信息，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並有使者被差往列國去，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"說：起來吧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一同起來與以東爭戰！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我使你－以東在列國中為最小的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被人大大藐視。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"住在山穴中、居所在高處的啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你因狂傲自欺，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"心裏說：誰能將我拉下地去呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你雖如大鷹高飛，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在星宿之間搭窩，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必從那裏拉下你來。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"盜賊若來在你那裏，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"或強盜夜間而來－","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你何竟被剪除－","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"豈不偷竊直到夠了呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摘葡萄的若來到你那裏，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"豈不剩下些葡萄呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以掃的隱密處何竟被搜尋？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他隱藏的寶物何竟被查出？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"與你結盟的都送你上路，直到交界；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"與你和好的欺騙你，且勝過你；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"與你一同吃飯的設下網羅陷害你；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在你心裏毫無聰明。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華說：到那日，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我豈不從以東除滅智慧人？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從以掃山除滅聰明人？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"提幔哪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的勇士必驚惶，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"甚至以掃山的人都被殺戮剪除。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["以東受罰的原因"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"因你向兄弟雅各行強暴，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"羞愧必遮蓋你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你也必永遠斷絕。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"當外人擄掠雅各的財物，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"外邦人進入他的城門，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為耶路撒冷拈鬮的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你竟站在一旁，像與他們同夥。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你兄弟遭難的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你不當瞪眼看着；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"猶大人被滅的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你不當因此歡樂；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們遭難的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你不當說狂傲的話。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我民遭災的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你不當進他們的城門；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們遭災的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你不當瞪眼看着他們受苦；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們遭災的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你不當伸手搶他們的財物；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你不當站在岔路口剪除他們中間逃脫的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們遭難的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你不當將他們剩下的人交付仇敵。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["上帝要審判萬國"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"text":"耶和華降罰的日子臨近萬國。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你怎樣行，他也必照樣向你行；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的報應必歸到你頭上。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們猶大人在我聖山怎樣喝了苦杯，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"萬國也必照樣常常地喝；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"且喝且咽，他們就歸於無有。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["以色列的勝利"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"text":"在錫安山必有逃脫的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那山也必成聖；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雅各家必得原有的產業。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雅各家必成為大火；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"約瑟家必為火焰；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以掃家必如碎稭；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"火必將他燒着吞滅。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以掃家必無餘剩的。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"text":"南地的人必得以掃山；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"高原的人必得非利士地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也得以法蓮地和撒馬利亞地；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"便雅憫人必得基列。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在迦南人中被擄的以色列眾人","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必得地直到撒勒法；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在西法拉中被擄的耶路撒冷人","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必得南地的城邑。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必有拯救者上到錫安山，審判以掃山；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"國度就歸耶和華了。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/OBA/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JON/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/AMO/9.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":21}